<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Equity Corp Intl.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Equity Corp Intl.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>J.P. Morgan said it initiated coverage of Equity Corp International with a buy rating.</p>
<p>-- set a 12-month price target of $28 a share.</p>
<p>-- expects Equity Corp to earn $0.71 a share in 1997 and $0.88 a share in 1998.</p>
<p>-- Equity Corp was off 1/16 to 22-13/16.</p>
</text>
